{
  "id": 8833333493959,
  "title": "Fantasy Art Fantasy Dragon Quilt Set with Dragon Scales And Bedroom Setting",
  "handle": "fantasy-art-fantasy-dragon-comforter-set-with-dragon-scales-and-bedroom-setting-239aaba3e2-239aaba3e2",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into a magical realm with the custom Dragon Quilt Set by Jeminise. Featuring a captivating digital fantasy illustration of a majestic dragon amidst colorful clouds, this cozy bedding set is the perfect gift for dragon lovers, kids, teens, and fantasy art enthusiasts. Designed for comfort and style, it brings a vibrant and unique touch to your home decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Touch:</strong> Customization options allow you to personalize the quilt with a name or custom text input (up to 20 characters) for a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Crafted from a high-quality microfiber and cotton-polyester blend, offering a soft, breathable, and cozy experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Bedding Set:</strong> This versatile bedding set is available in multiple sizes and can be completed with optional matching pillow shams (20x30 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Warmth:</strong> Designed for year-round comfort, making it perfect for napping, bedding layer, or even cozy outdoor camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Durable and easy to maintain with convenient machine wash support.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy / Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon / Fantasy Art</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King, Throw</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input (Optional Name)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
